hythm.\\nSecond 4 [0:03-0:04] — HUD Popup Text: \"STEP 4: DISPLACE THE LANDSCAPE\" — Thermal shock causes broad rock shelves to split and slide, molten channels to expand, and vapor columns to surge across the basin.\\nSecond 5 [0:04-0:05] — HUD Popup Text: \"STEP 5: ACHIEVE VALLEY-SCALE FORGE\" — The entire landscape glows with interconnected thermal deformation as the machine reshapes kilometers of terrain in one continuous operation.\\nSeconds 6-8 [0:05-0:08]: HUD text completely fades; the camera begins extremely close to a rotating gear tooth and smoothly pulls backward through layers of mechanical structure until the full furnace array and its glowing landscape-scale thermal patterns dominate the frame, unbroken motion, zero cuts, exactly 8 seconds.\"\n19: ,\n20: \"10\": \"Exactly 8 seconds, 9:16 vertical aspect ratio, photorealistic cinematic render, smooth continuous motion, no cuts, maximum cinematic realism. Audio: no human voice, only cinematic BGM.\\n\\nThe final Solar Gear Furnace Array is an impossible 25-square-kilometer solar megastructure, with thousands of skyscraper-scale towers, millions of synchronized gears, vast mirror rings, underground drive systems, and a central thermal receiver hundreds of meters across. The entire valley has become a mechanically controlled furnace landscape of molten channels, glassy ridges, fractured mountains, towering steam vortices, and moving incandescent focal paths under a blazing sun.\\n\\nSecond 1 [0:00-0:01] — HUD Popup Text: \"STEP 1: ACTIVATE MASTER GEAR\" — A colossal central gear begins rotating, mechanically propagating synchronized motion through every visible tower and mirror ring across the valley.\\nSecond 2 [0:01-0:02] — HUD Popup Text: \"STEP 2: RELEASE MEGASCALE TORQUE\" — Nested gear reductions transfer impossible rotational force outward, causing the entire reflective field to accelerate while remaining perfectly coordinated.\\nSecond 3 [0:02-0:03] — HUD Popup Text: \"STEP 3: FOCUS THE ARTIFICIAL SUN\" — Millions of reflections collapse into an intensely luminous moving point, creating a blinding thermal core that visibly bends the atmosphere.\\nSecond 4 [0:03-0:04] — HUD Popup Text: \"STEP 4: COMMAND THE THERMAL LANDSCAPE\" — The focal point sweeps across the valley, simultaneously melting ridges, splitting rock shelves, boiling moisture, and generating enormous rising vapor columns.\\nSecond 5 [0:04-0:05] — HUD Popup Text: \"STEP 5: FORGE THE ENTIRE VALLEY\" — The complete landscape erupts into a controlled field of incandescent deformation as molten rock streams through trenches and cools into vast glassy structures behind the thermal front.\\nSeconds 6-8 [0:05-0:08]: HUD text completely fades; the camera executes a majestic uninterrupted vertical ascent from the incandescent thermal front, passing above the rotating vapor vortex and mirror towers before revealing the entire impossible solar gear furnace spanning the valley beneath the sun, every gear and mirror still moving in perfect synchronization, unbroken motion, zero cuts, exactly 8 seconds.\"\n21: }\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":10510,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T20:38:57Z","thinking":"Analyzing the provided JSON data reveals the structure for generating video prompts across ten levels. Each level follows a consistent template: an 8-second vertical video, photorealistic cinematic rendering, smooth motion without cuts, and cinematic background music, alongside five HUD popups and camera movement in the last three seconds. The task involves crafting distinct video descriptions for each level based on this foundational structure.\n\n\nConstructing the anti-ban timing architecture requires both micro and macro layers for robust operation. The micro-layer introduces random delays and staggered starts to mimic human behavior and avoid detection. The macro-layer establishes active work windows with hibernation periods, further randomizing the operational footprint.\n\n\nChecking for existing prompts associated with each idea, initiating the generation of a ten-level escalation system if incomplete. Each level will feature specific video and image prompts. If API request fails, a deterministic fallback strategy will be employed to avoid any blockages.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"\"\"\nSEO Engine Models Stub\nProvides data structures and models for SEO generation fallbacks.\n\"\"\"\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field\nfrom typing import List, Optional, Dict, Any\n\n@dataclass\nclass SEOKeywordMetric:\n    keyword: str\n    search_volume: int = 0\n    competition: float = 0.0\n    cpc: float = 0.0\n\n@dataclass\nclass SEOCompetitor:\n    title: str\n    channel: str\n    video_id: str = \"\"\n    view_count: int = 0\n    url: str = \"\"\n\n@dataclass\nclass SEOPackage:\n    title: str\n    description: str\n    tags: List[str]\n    category: str = \"Science & Technology\"\n    language: str = \"en\"\n    upload_ready: bool = True\n    keywords: List[SEOKeywordMetric] = field(default_factory=list)\n    competitors: List[SEOCompetitor] = field(default_factory=list)\n","Description":"Create seo_models.py in seo_engine","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube/Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/seo_engine/seo_models.py","toolAction":"Creating seo_models.py","toolSummary":"Create seo_models.py stub"}}]}
